1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:06,620
The gear on the right opens Settings.

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:11,480
On the Account page, choose which time zone times are shown in.

3
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:15,290
The Trading page holds your trading preferences.

4
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:19,120
Choose whether trade sizes show as lots or as the full amount.

5
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:26,100
With Full Amount, 0.01 lots shows as 1,000.

6
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:30,960
Default Trader Range is the slippage you accept, filled in on every order ticket.

7
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:35,820
Default Orders Distance sets the stop, limit and entry distance for each instrument.

8
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:40,180
Here you can also turn notifications and sounds on or off.

9
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:43,450
Changes apply straight away. Close Settings when you are done.

